。不过这个偷偷将女孩抱走的老仆……难道是女孩的父母良心发现了？让人偷偷将她抱走。不可能，同样是上位者的战轻狂明白，一切可能存在的危险都要扼杀在摇篮里，这样的情况一般都是偷偷处理掉的，绝不会留下把柄。可是一个老仆有这么大的胆子，敢违抗家主的命令，将小女孩送走？看来，这一点有待探究。而没有灵力的南宫轻狂就这样被老仆带到偏僻的小城，在南宫世家旁系里生存下来。没爹没娘的孩子，日子又能好到哪里去？随着年龄的增长，女孩的灵力没有一丝一毫的增长，就像个普通人一样，长得瘦弱不堪的她或许连普通人还不如，所以从小到大没少受别人的欺负，整日的打骂早已经成了家常便饭，甚至活的没有一丁点的尊严。几年前，老仆也去世了，对少女来说，这世上仅剩的的温暖也没有了。因此南宫轻狂过的更加凄惨，随之而来的只剩没完没了的欺辱打骂，任谁心情不顺，都要拿她出气一番，在这样偏僻的地方，谁又知道少女原本的真实身份应该是一个世家小姐？可是这“世家小姐”却每天都是一身伤，吃不饱穿不暖，寄人篱下，遭人白眼，本来堂堂嫡系的千金大小姐现在竟落得与乞丐无异的下场。看到这，战轻狂更深的感受到身体传来的悲伤，一丝丝的萦绕心间，酸涩的想流泪。画面一转，四个少年将南宫轻狂堵在墙角，一顿毒打咒骂之后，也不知道喂她吃了什么，不过想来也不是什么好东西。狞笑的少年一副看好戏的样子，其余几人衣着华贵，冷眼旁观着。有一个少年好像是等不及了，上来撕扯她的衣服，不一会儿就露出大片的肌肤，头发也散了。看到南宫轻狂的卑微的求饶，颤抖的反抗，满身的伤，流泪的眼，惶恐的面容…战轻狂只觉得身体里一把火在烧，恨不得将那几个少年碎尸万段。接着南宫轻狂终于不堪忍受，掏出一把破旧的匕首，胡乱的砍着，趁几个少年不注意，狼狈的逃了。一路上跌跌撞撞，直到跑到现在她所处的林子里，疲惫的身体才跌倒了，也许是这些年的生活早已经抹杀了她所有的希望，倒下的南宫轻狂无神的望着天，想想她这十三年过的什么样的日子啊，她是弃子，可是她也是个人哪！难道她没有活下去的权利吗？出生不是她能选择的，不能修习灵力也不是她的错啊！她从不奢望成为强者，做什么人上人，只要能够渺小卑微的活着，有饭吃，有地方睡，不受打骂，她就已经很满足了。可是，为什么要连她这小小的心愿都要剥夺，这世间还剩下什么，还有什么是她拥有的？还有什么值得她留恋的？没有，什么都没有了，就这样吧！她累了，好累好累……累到已经再也坚持不下去了，最终少女眼角流下一滴晶莹的泪水，缓缓闭上了双眼。将这一幕幕看在眼里，战轻狂松开攥紧的拳头，很快就整理好了思绪，南宫轻狂在无数的迫害下，放弃了生命。而她战轻狂重生在这具身体上，那么作为报答，她自然要做点什么才是！南宫轻狂，你安息吧！你所遭受的一切，我会让那些人十倍百倍的奉还，无论是抛弃你的父母，还是那些欺负过你的畜生败类，欠你的，我都会替你讨回来！伤你的，拿命来偿！挣扎起身，战轻狂知道她现在必须处理身上的伤，刚想迈步，突然身体传来火热的巨浪，该死！一定是刚才被喂的药！好哇，真是好！眼中一丝阴鹜划过，不过是刚刚十三岁的少女，还未及笄，至于这样对她吗？真是好哇！那几个少年，她一个都不会放过！当务之急是解了药性，按照身体的记忆，她向一个方向走去，记得那里有个湖的，是南宫轻狂唯一的“自由之地”，想到这，她感到无尽的可悲！也就十三岁的年纪，被亲生父母抛弃，没人疼没人爱，受尽白眼，冷落，毒打，责骂，换谁谁都会承受不下去吧！急步走到湖边，只顾身体情况的战轻狂因此没有注意到那边坐着的一个人。该死！到底是那帮人渣给南宫轻狂喂了什么药？身体越来越热，冰冷的湖水也压不下身体的火热，被药性所折磨，她只感觉力气越来越小，不行，再这样下去，她会沉溺的。从湖中蹿出，少女奋力的像岸边划去。到了岸上，大口的喘气，历来镇静的她不由得苦笑，难道天要亡她？刚想起身，常年的警惕性让她立刻向旁边望去，嘶！那边有人，什么时候在那里的？战轻狂不由得打量，一个男人？一个高大威猛的男人？等等，男人？有救了，太好了，拖着软绵绵的身体，战轻狂向他走去。战家家训：只要能活着，不计一切代价。刚走到男人旁边，战轻狂正想扑之，结果突然间，就被男人给扇走。“本尊今天心情好，不杀你。”说完，男人收拢了一下衣服。男人挥手之间，一身尊贵的气势便显露无疑，被一个卑微的人类给碰到了，这让男人有些厌恶的皱紧了眉。他不过是有些烦心事，见这里景色不错，所以想散散心，却怎么也没想到会遇到一个渺小的人类。不远处的战轻狂摔得不轻，却还是站起来，心中只有一个信念，既然老天让她命不该绝，那么她就一定珍惜这次机会，她不能死，绝对不能死！然而当她刚走到男人身边，就又被拍走。“这里的女人现在这么开放了？”男人有些诧异。趴在地上的战轻狂顿时憋了口气，丫的，他还拍上瘾了？好半天没动，就在男人以为她放弃的时候，她脚上蓄好力气，一个猛扑，居然成功了！丫的，让你拍我，让你扇我，老娘不发威，你当我是病猫啊？男人的身躯怔住了片刻，很快就反应过来了。看着狼狈的女孩，有些好笑，这恼怒的小脸摆明了小猫很生气，后果很严重。战轻狂心中烦躁，趁着喘气的功夫，一个不小心撞到男人的额头上，顿时又眼冒金星了。“该死的！难道是铁做的不成……”“好了，别再继续了，后果你承担不起。”看她的样子，男人就知道发生了什么。见男人还想阻止她，战轻狂不耐了，她都这样了，让他当个解药能死啊？再说了，吃亏的人是她好不好？明明看上去很弱小的人发起怒来，还真是不能小觑。一招擒拿手使出，少女顿立刻得意了。有些破烂的粉衣上边全是泥土，露出伤痕累累的身体，青青紫紫的伤口，一看就是被人给打成这样的。看到这里，男人挑挑眉，继续手下的动作。修长的大手将遮住面容的头发拨开，露出一张稚嫩的脸，看样子不过十二三岁，此时，正充满不正常的红，额头上还有一块红色的圆形印记，想必是刚才和他撞上才造成的，如画的眉眼，大大的水眸，正可怜兮兮的望着他，小巧的鼻子，红润的唇正微微张着，引人采撷，还有精致的面容……突然，男人挑起嘴角，笑的诡异，“这是你自找的！”抬起雾蒙蒙的双眼，轻狂想将这趁人之危的男人给记住，来日也好报仇，却发现，根本就看不清男人的脸。不过这丝毫不影响她心里的鄙夷，死男人最后祈祷，以后别犯到她手里！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 2 Without a word of \"hmm\", the ragged little person opened her eyes, and the pain radiating from her body made her raise her teeth. Zhan Qingkuang looked at the blue sky above his head, the dense and tall woods, the occasional birds flying by, and smelled the fresh air in his nose, thinking about what happened. Zhan Qingyang led people to kill her because of the poisonous information. As a result, both sides suffered losses. Zhan Qingyang lost his wife and lost his troops. Not only did he lose his life, but she herself was also poisoned and died, and there was an explosion. So why is she here now? She's not dead? Where is this? Suddenly, there was a sharp pain in my head, and a large number of memories rushed out crazily. It turns out that this is Lingyin Continent, a world where spiritual power is practiced and the strong are respected. Seventy percent of this world is made up of spiritual cultivators. Big fists are the last word. And the place where she is is the Jiasheng Empire. In terms of strength ranking, there are also the Lounan Empire, the Nebula Empire, and the Xiuwu Empire. Each empire has major aristocratic families. The other three kingdoms are not very clear. The four major families in the Jiasheng Empire are: Dongfang Family, Nangong Family, Ximen Family, and Beitang Family. Each family has been passed down for hundreds of years. In addition to the direct line, there are countless collateral lines. There are still many small and medium-sized families who cannot be on the stage and rely on the four major families to survive and be driven by them. Thinking of this, she saw a little girl, about two or three years old, who was crying after being scolded. There was a man and a woman above her who were talking about something. The disgust and resentment between their eyebrows were not concealed at all. Then, after they threw countless tea cups, they angrily threw away their sleeves and walked away without even looking back, so they didn't see how longingly the little girl looked at their backs. Then the girl was hugged by an old servant and carried away from the huge house through a remote door. The child's eyes were filled with tears and she kept struggling. Although she couldn't hear the sound, she could still tell from the child's mouth that she was calling the words \"father\" and \"mother\". The unwillingness, resentment, and grievance coming from her body made her realize that her current body was that of the little girl back then. It turns out that the little girl is a direct descendant of the second family of the Jiasheng Empire, the daughter of the head of the family, Nangong Qingkuang. She was supposed to be a noble young lady, but she was abandoned by her family because her body could not gather spiritual power. If people knew that the head of the second noble family had such a useless daughter, they would probably laugh out loud! Therefore, such a shameful existence must not become a \"stain\" on the family, which is why the scene just happened. But this old servant who secretly took the girl away...could it be that the girl's parents found out? Let someone take her away secretly. Impossible. Zhan Qingkuang, who is also a superior, understands that all possible dangers must be nipped in the cradle. Such situations are usually handled secretly without leaving any clues. But an old servant has such courage to disobey the master's order and send the little girl away? It seems that this needs to be explored. Nangong Qingkuang, who had no spiritual power, was taken to a remote town by his old servant and survived in a branch of the Nangong family. How can a child's life be better without a father and a mother? As she grows older, the girl's spiritual power does not increase at all. She is just like an ordinary person. She is so thin that she may not even be as good as an ordinary person. Therefore, she has been bullied by others since she was a child. Being beaten and scolded all day long has become commonplace, and she does not even have any dignity in her life. A few years ago, the old servant also passed away. For the girl, the remaining warmth in the world was gone. Therefore, Nangong's frivolous life became even more miserable, and what followed was endless bullying and beatings. Anyone who was in a bad mood would take it out on her. In such a remote place, who knew that the girl's true identity should be a young lady from a wealthy family? But this \"young lady from an aristocratic family\" was injured every day, had no food and clothing, no warmth, depended on others, and was looked down upon by others. The daughter of a noble family, who was originally a direct descendant, now ended up like a beggar. Seeing this, Zhan Qingkuang felt the sadness coming from his body more deeply, lingering in his heart and making him want to cry. The scene turned, and four teenagers blocked Nangong Qingkuang in a corner. After beating and cursing her, they didn't know what they fed her, but I guess it wasn't anything good. The grinning young man looked like he was watching a good show, while the other people, dressed in luxurious clothes, looked on with cold eyes. One boy seemed to be unable to wait any longer and came up to tear her clothes apart. After a while, a large area of ​​skin was exposed and her hair was loose. Seeing Nangong Qingkuang's humble begging for mercy, trembling resistance, injuries all over his body, tearful eyes, and frightened face... Zhan Qingkuang felt like a fire was burning in his body, and he wanted to tear those young men into pieces. Then Nangong Qingkuang finally couldn't stand it any longer, so he took out a worn-out dagger and cut it randomly, and escaped in embarrassment when several teenagers were not paying attention. Stumbling along the way, it was not until she reached the forest where she was now that her exhausted body fell. Perhaps these years of life had already wiped out all her hopes. The fallen Nangong looked at the sky frivolously and aimlessly, thinking about what kind of life she had lived in the past thirteen years. She was an abandoned child, but she was also a human being! Doesn't she have the right to live? It was not her choice to be born, and it was not her fault that she could not practice spiritual power! She never expected to be a strong person or a master. As long as she could live a small and humble life, with food to eat, a place to sleep, and not to be beaten or scolded, she would be satisfied. But why should she be deprived of even her little wish? What else is left in this world and what else does she have? What else is there for her to miss? No, there is nothing, that’s it! She was tired, so tired, so tired... so tired that she could no longer hold on. Finally, a crystal tear fell from the corner of the girl's eyes and she slowly closed her eyes. this scene", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}